*********************************************************************************************
SEQUENCE OF AllureUtils and AllureListener

Let's understand the sequence.
1. You run Maven
mvn clean test

2. TestNG starts
onStart() executes
Creates environment.properties

3. First test starts
onTestStart() executes
Adds smoke/regression tags

4. Other tests execute
Tags are added to each test

5. Allure report
Displays test results, tags and environment information.
