How ConfigBuilder and RequestSpecFactory work together
This is the most important connection in your framework.
You run Maven
mvn clean test -Denv=QA

ConfigBuilder
Reads QA.properties
QA environment selected

RequestSpecFactory
Calls ConfigBuilder.getBaseUrl()
Builds the common API request configuration

API Test
Executes requests against QA